<p>For eligible US deliveries, <strong>request a return within 7 calendar days</strong>, counting the tracking delivery date as day one. For orders arriving in separate packages, count from the final package.</p>
<h2 id="returns-eligibility">What can be returned</h2>
<p>Items must be unworn, with tags attached and their original clear garment bag and SKU label. Beauty products, bodysuits, face masks, intimates/lingerie, jewelry, swimwear and open-pack wholesale orders are final sale. Direct exchanges are unavailable. These exclusions do not remove rights relating to faulty or incorrect goods.</p>
<h2 id="returns-request">Start your return</h2>
<p>{% render 'policy-contact' %} with your order number, items and reason. Include photographs for damage or an incorrect item. We arrange the supplier authorization and provide the return address and RA number; include that number in the parcel. <strong>Send it back within 7 calendar days of submitting the request.</strong> Keep tracking and proof of postage.</p>
<h2 id="returns-costs">Costs &amp; condition</h2>
<p>You pay return postage unless the item arrived damaged or there was a shipping error. Original shipping and handling are normally non-refundable, subject to applicable law. Returns outside the required condition or time limits may be declined or incur a 20% restocking deduction; we will explain any decision.</p>
<h2 id="returns-refunds">Refunds</h2>
<p>Allow approximately 5–7 business days after the warehouse receives your return for inspection and processing. Aloir Apparel issues approved customer refunds to the original payment method and confirms the outcome. Bank posting times vary. Contact us if an approved refund is missing. Mandatory remedies for defective goods or canceled unshipped orders take precedence over ordinary return exclusions and fees.</p>
